# PokeHex.Services

- Wrap PKHeX.Core behind session/facade types (`SaveSession`, `SaveIO`, `PokemonEditFacade`, `LegalityService`).
- Prefer `SaveUtil.GetVariantSAV` / try-get APIs for detection. Force-load only when the user opts in.
- Never log raw save bytes. Mark session dirty after mutations; support undo via byte snapshots where implemented.
- Generation-aware: guard gen-specific fields before writing.
- Spanish exception/user messages for load failures (unsupported size, corrupt, hackrom mismatch).
